# About

## What this is

A small server on a LoRa mesh. It serves a pages and a message board.

## What is the throughput?

Every fetch spends airtime. A page costs about 1s
A forum post costs about the same. 
Keep pages under 2KB and they stay under five seconds TTA.

> Check what a page costs before publishing it:
> python -m vagrantnet.common.page pages/index.vn

